==Arabic==

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ص|د|ر}}.

===Pronunciation 1===
* {{ar-IPA|صَدَرَ}}

====Verb====
{{anchor|Arabic-v-I}}{{ar-verb|I|a|u,i}} {{tlb|ar|intransitive}}

# to [[emerge]]; to [[come up]]; to [[spring]]; to [[issue]]; to [[rise]]
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|99|6|passage=يَوْمَئِذٍ '''يَصْدُرُ''' النَّاسُ أَشْتَاتًا لِّيُرَوْا أَعْمَالَهُمْ|t=On that Day people '''will proceed''' in separate groups to be shown [the consequences of] their deeds.}}
## to [[materialize]], to [[happen]], to [[occur]]
##: {{syn|ar|حَدَثَ}}
## to [[emerge]] as if from a [[source]], to [[proceed]], to [[emanate]], to [[arise]], to [[originate]], to [[stem]], to [[spring]]
##: {{syn|ar|اِنْبَثَقَ}}
## to be [[released]]; to be [[public]] or [[available]], to be [[out]]; to [[come out]]; to [[circulate]]
##: {{uxi|ar|صَدَرَ الْكِتَابُ مِنْ دَارِ النَّشْرِ يَوْمَ الْأَرْبِعَاء.|t=The book issued from the publisher on Wednesday.}}

